[00:43.14] <same old shoes sittin' there>
[00:46.32] <Coffee's strong, but the day feels thin>
[00:49.62] <like it's already been lived in>
[00:53.38] <News keep talkin' 'bout what's ahead, promises nobody said>
[00:59.68] <Used to listen, used to care, now it just sound like air>
[01:04.98] <Ain't no future like yesterday>
